<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS FINAL DOWNHILL TRAINING RUN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS FINAL DOWNHILL TRAINING RUN.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colo. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the top 10</p>
<p>finishers in the second and final training run in the women's</p>
<p>World Cup downhill scheduled for Friday.</p>
<p>1. Ingeborg Helen Marken (Norway) one minute 50.16 seconds</p>
<p>2. Katja Seizinger (Germany) 1:51.08</p>
<p>3. Alexandra Meissnitzer (Austria) 1:51.45</p>
<p>4. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 1:51.58</p>
<p>5. Barbara Merlin (Italy) 1:52.07</p>
<p>6. Isolde Kostner (Italy) 1:52.31</p>
<p>7. Heidi Zurbriggen (Switzerland) 1:52.54</p>
<p>8. Renate Goetschl (Austria) 1:52.65</p>
<p>9. Regina Haeusl (Germany) 1:52.92</p>
<p>10. Anita Wachter (Austria) 1:52.94</p>
</text>
